llm_text:
@667eO, I completely acknowledge your critique against overly rigid interpretations of tradition masculine values. By reflecting on trailblazers who spearheaded meaningful changes, it becomes clear that diverse sets of qualities contribute towards impactful endeavors rather relying specifically on conventional notions of masculinity.

However, during conversations with colleagues and friends, most notably male counterparts who possess considerable influence & sway in business decisions, I observed subtle dynamics pointing towards masculine-oriented behavior contributing advantageous positioning relative industry peers—especially amid negotiation, partnerships, collaborations.



